0000219C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 01BA 01BE 012F 3759 02C5 0634 2971 01CF 02EA 378F 00DC 0D12 05A2 3797 00B2 379E 0095 04B2 00DC 0257 22D9 01BE 012F 37A8 02A7 00C1 37AD 00FD 37B4 0019 FFFF 3759 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "You want to speed up your computer ? No prob... , I'll just double the frequency . Uh , you may want to move back a couple of yards ..."
