000022DA: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 1A16 00C1 248C 3888 1597 00DC 05A2 3890 00B2 01C3 1597 3898 00BC 00C1 389D 38A5 0095 1247 38A9 FFFF 1597 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "For a more playful mouse , just replace the little mouse ball with a 6-sided die . Thanks Honk!!!"
0000230C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0417 0092 00C1 1E00 3719 00DC 00A3 033F 38B1 013D 38B5 01C3 3772 02A7 093B 031A 38BB 0151 024B FFFF 3772 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "This is a family game , Commander !!! Put that nasty little joystick back where it came from !"
0000233E: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 1A16 38C0 30D6 0142 38C8 00DC 38D1 004D 0634 38D6 0142 3606 05F3 004D 38DE 0A0B 0095 241F 2961 0D88 280A 00DC 1A8C 38E7 0257 0056 34E1 38EF 0151 38F6 38FC 3904 0019 FFFF 377B ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "For sharper color and contrast , spit on your glasses and wipe them on somebody else . If everything looks green , that's because you are under attack from alien vampire cabbages ..."
0000238C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 2F8E 0634 3782 0092 3295 005A 31AE 0019 016F 01F9 0199 0274 01CF 0019 18DC 089B 00DC 390D 00C1 3911 391A 03EE 1F1E 0A14 391E 3927 1043 FFFF 3782 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "So your CDROM is way too slow ... What can I say ? ... Next time , buy a circular saw or maybe an electric toothbrush ...."
000023CE: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 01BA 066E 00B2 2D04 024B 0758 3932 0596 012F 3938 0095 0CC8 20E8 393C 3945 3949 0142 394F 0D9A 00B2 3954 0095 00CF 24C3 00DC 041C 031A 01CF FFFF 2D04 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "You hate the music ! That one's easy to fix . Just hit \"CONTROL ALT DEL\", and flip over the CD . That's better , isn't it ?"
00002412: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3957 0224 01E3 395D 00C1 0639 02E7 0634 3098 3965 033F 1C99 396A 031A 3972 1592 0019 0D85 397A 036A 0010 0019 FFFF 3788 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Seems like I'm sensing a fault in your sound card !!! Try hitting it awfully hard ... It works for me ..."
