0000247F: MENU 0001 399E 39A2 39AC 39B6 39C3 39CA 093B 1281 03E5 0665 39CE ; talk | ego | super_ego | under_ego | end_of_month | libido | who | where | when | what | how | why
0000249A: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0406 2FA0 39D2 39E0 0019 00CF 00C1 2408 02E7 00C1 39E8 0FB6 00DC 00A3 0095 FFFF 3980 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "A free psychotherapy session ... That's a once in a lifetime offer , Commander ."
000024C4: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 34A7 0019 39F1 02C5 1955 2AD5 0019 39F8 00B2 2033 0278 013D 3A00 0634 2CF1 0553 FFFF 3980 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Relax ... Loosen up those muscles ... Choose the first thing that enters your head :"
000024F0: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3A07 0169 3A0D 07A3 0142 1427 0A21 24C3 0019 0C7E 0634 3A11 3A1A 012F 05E9 00B2 32F1 0019 FFFF 39B6 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Think about me, Commander, and you'll feel better ... let your thoughts stray to Olga the translator ..."
00002520: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 006C 0A17 00FD 0A86 3A20 0092 07A0 3A26 3A2C 012F 00B2 3523 00FD 12F4 00DC 00A3 0019 FFFF 39B6 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The end of one month is so often close to the start of another , Commander ..."
0000254E: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 11A2 0019 34A7 0019 32DB 004D 3A32 0488 024B FFFF 39B6 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Good ... Relax ... Click on anything... NOW !"
0000256C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 027E 024B 027E 024B 0758 19C5 0634 3797 0E8F 0019 0869 0422 00B2 0529 0A86 00DC 00A3 0095 0A74 0911 3A3E 3A44 0095 2EC1 01F9 09EA 0257 00BC 013D 0019 FFFF 39A2 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Ha ! Ha ! That was your double talking ... You're not the only one , Commander . Go see Super ZEN . He can help you with that ..."
000025B4: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 01BA 0229 0E54 3A48 00C1 28E5 00DC 15CC 2826 0CD8 00DC 04B5 00C1 01C3 3A4E 00DC 00D6 01CF 0019 FFFF 39A2 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "You think you're quite a person , but deep down , there's a little child , right ? ..."
000025E6: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0450 00C1 3A54 02E7 0257 00DC 00A3 0019 FFFF 39A2 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "There's a rebel in you , Commander ..."
00002602: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3A5A 0019 0AEC 100E 04A0 00B2 3A62 05BB 0019 01BA 05A2 3A69 0426 042C 0019 FFFF 39AC ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Careful ... You'll never get the stains out ... You just ask Cap'n Bob ..."
0000262C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 1200 3A6D 00C1 3A76 3A2C 012F 3A7C 0095 3A82 0019 FFFF 399E ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "You've attained a state close to PRANA . Congratulations ..."
0000264C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 07D9 00DC 0257 09E0 01E3 3411 00DC 00A3 0019 FFFF 399E ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Yes , you !! I'm impressed , Commander ..."
0000266A: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 01E3 395D 2D21 3A92 02E7 00B2 3431 3433 00FD 0634 00D6 3442 0019 FFFF 39C3 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "I'm sensing strange pulsions in the B cortex of your right hemisphere ..."
00002690: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 07A3 3A9B 0092 00C1 3AA4 3AAD 012F 3AB3 0095 2F8E 13D3 3ABA 0019 000C 3ABF 042C 0866 0A14 2FCA 0019 FFFF 39C3 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Commander, chastity is a stepping stone to wisdom . So stay calm ... Let cap'n Bob be an example ..."
000026C4: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0E33 14F2 01F9 0866 3AC5 0142 3ACA 0095 099C 0422 2911 0879 09CB 01CF FFFF 39C3 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Space travel can be long and lonely . Why not watch some TV ?"
000026EC: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 159D 024B 006C 08AC 0019 FFFF 39C3 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Ahh ! The ondoyants ..."
00002702: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 05D5 1A8C 00C1 3AD1 3AD9 0019 18D6 00B2 1A93 0092 012F 0866 0687 03CE 00B2 0A17 00FD 02C0 3AE0 0019 FFFF 39CA ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Now that's a serious matter ... Maybe the answer is to be found at the end of this adventure ..."
00002736: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 006C 3AEA 00FD 3AFA 3B00 0718 0257 3B07 00DC 00A3 0019 FFFF 39CA ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The cyberloneliness of cheap memory makes you dizzy , Commander ..."
00002758: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3B0D 0E89 0019 FFFF 093B ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Over there ..."
0000276A: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3B12 00DC 02ED 3B1B FFFF 1281 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Tomorrow , no doubt..."
0000277E: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 00CF 00C1 1F24 0A86 00DC 00A3 0019 FFFF 03E5 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "That's a tough one , Commander ..."
00002798: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 159D 024B 0165 01CF 006C 1A93 0092 3B24 0257 00DC 00A3 0095 FFFF 0665 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Ahh ! How ? The answer is within you , Commander ."
000027BC: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 00AD 3B2B 0553 3B33 033F 0ACC 0C42 3A69 3B3B 03E5 3B44 FFFF 39CE ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "It's obvious : BECAUSE !!! And don't ask \"Because what ?\""
