000027FA: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0165 0169 00C1 3B4C 3B53 02E7 1483 313E 01CF 39F8 00C1 25F2 0095 0450 0529 0A86 00D6 0A86 0019 FFFF 3239 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "How about a simple exercise in mind power ? Choose a number . There's only one right one ..."
0000282C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0977 0430 012F 3B5C 1859 3304 0095 01BA 3523 00DC 00A3 0019 FFFF 3239 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "We're going to count murffalos together . You start , Commander ..."
00002850: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3B62 12BE 3B6C 024B 01BA 37E1 28E5 024B 39F8 00C1 25F2 3B77 286A 0142 3B7F 0019 FFFF 3239 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Pranayama through numerology ! You lucky person ! Choose a number between ten and twenty ..."
