000028B2: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3BA0 FFFF 1C11 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Two"
000028C0: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3BA4 FFFF 05C4 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Three"
000028CE: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3BAA FFFF 1C15 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Four"
000028DC: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3BAF FFFF 2358 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Five"
000028EA: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3BB4 FFFF 1C1A ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Six"
000028F8: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3BB8 FFFF 29D1 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Seven"
00002906: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3BBE FFFF 1C1E ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Eight"
00002914: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3BC4 0019 3BC9 07D4 00DC 28AB 0019 0199 3BCE 0E54 3A48 3BD4 0125 1043 FFFF 3B47 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Nine ... GOOD WORK , COMMANDER ... I sense you're quite relaxed now ...."
