0000295A: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 3BF9 0169 056C 02E7 3C06 00DC 00A3 01CF FFFF 322C ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Explanations about anything in particular , Commander ?"
00002976: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 099C 00DC 0E54 00A3 3C11 1732 0869 00B2 3C18 00FD 02C0 0174 0019 FFFF 2810 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "Why , you're Commander Blood, Commander. You're the hero of this story ..."
0000299C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0426 042C 0092 1158 3C1D 0095 2EC1 3C24 0326 0630 0019 FFFF 1CE0 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob is our master . He built us all ..."
000029BE: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0426 042C 0092 158D 158D 0C67 00DC 00A3 0095 3B0D 3C2A 2933 0C67 0019 FFFF 1CE0 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob is very very old , Commander . Over 800,000 years old ..."
000029E6: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0426 042C 3C32 0010 012F 341B 3C3D 147D 22A7 0056 1158 3C43 012F 00B2 03D1 03F1 0019 FFFF 1CE0 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob programmed me to detect black holes which are our gateway to the BIG BANG ..."
00002A14: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0426 042C 0092 158D 158D 3C4B 0095 2EC1 0A10 00C1 3C57 00DC 05A2 0224 0257 0095 01E3 00C1 0C2D 0019 FFFF 1CE0 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob is very very intelligent . He has a biobrain , just like you . I'm a cybernetic ..."
00002A48: TEXT 08BA FF 61 80 - - 0199 3C60 04F6 3C65 00DC 28AB 0019 FFFF 024D ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x61,0x80 "I HEAR AND OBEY , COMMANDER ..."
00002A62: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 006C 17BC 0092 1158 3C6A 00DC 3C24 09C8 0C2D 3C71 3C77 012F 3C81 3C88 FFFF 0708 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The ARK is our vessel , built by cybernetic units belonging to KANARY CORP."
00002A8A: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 00AD 3A48 00C1 0772 024B 057F 0315 3C8E 3C91 093B 00E3 01F9 3C9B 3CA2 03EE 3CA9 0019 FFFF 0708 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "It's quite a ship ! We have 16 CRYOBOXES where we can stock aliens or merchandise ..."
00002AB8: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 006C 0708 0092 3CB5 00BC 00B2 1500 3CBE 3CC3 02E7 00B2 3CCA 09D7 0019 FFFF 0708 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The Ark is equipped with the fastest warp drives in the entire universe ..."
00002AE0: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 006C 0708 0092 3CB5 00BC 0A14 3CD1 3CD6 1A40 3CDC 0019 006C 3CDF 0056 36C0 3CE4 0019 FFFF 0708 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The Ark is equipped with an ORXX layer called MA ... The Orrx are amazing missiles ..."
00002B0E: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0822 04C2 3CED 0315 0458 3CF6 0095 057F 0315 00B2 375F 00DC 00C1 3D00 0142 3D0B 09CB 0019 FFFF 0708 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "All onboard comforts have been provided . We have the telephone , a restaurant and widescreen TV ..."
00002B3E: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3CDC 0092 0A86 00FD 3D16 3D1F 00DC 00C1 33A9 00FD 11F9 3D2B 00DC 3D31 0109 09C8 0426 042C 0019 FFFF 3BDC ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "MA is one of nature's curiosities , a kind of space whale , genetically altered by Cap'n Bob ..."
00002B70: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3CDC 3D3D 0645 3D42 02E7 00B2 3D47 3D4C 006C 3D42 3D52 0753 3CD1 0019 FFFF 3BDC ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "MA lays her eggs in the PRAM ZONE. The eggs hatch into ORXX ..."
00002B98: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3CDC 0092 00C1 3D58 1379 00DC 00A3 0095 031D 0092 158D 3D58 012F 2D04 0019 FFFF 3CDC ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "MA is a sensitive being , Commander . She is very sensitive to music ..."
00002BC2: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3CDC 3D62 0529 3D67 3D71 0019 FFFF 3BDC ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "MA eats only synthetic strawberries ..."
00002BDA: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0426 042C 3D7E 3D67 3D71 0095 2EC1 3D84 05F3 00BC 09EA 0151 00B2 3C81 3D8E FFFF 3BDC ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Cap'n Bob loves synthetic strawberries . He perfected them with help from the KANARY geneticists."
00002C04: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3BDF 0056 3D9B 3DA2 3CE4 0095 1247 012F 05F3 00DC 0E54 12C6 3DA9 3DB3 0019 FFFF 3BDF ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Orxx are LIVING guided missiles . Thanks to them , you're always perfectly safe ..."
00002C2E: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 01BA 3DB8 0A14 3BDF 12BE 3DBE 3DC5 12BE 27D4 3DCC 0D85 3DD2 004D 2BA9 036A 0257 0019 FFFF 3BDF ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "You guide an Orxx through space, seeing through its eyes. It lands on planets for you ..."
00002C5C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 241F 04B5 0CB8 2F29 00DC 00B2 3BDF 0092 3DD8 0019 0F2B 0257 024B 0869 3DB3 02E7 3DE2 0019 FFFF 3BDF ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "If there's any danger , the Orxx is destroyed ... Not you ! You're safe in orbit ..."
00002C8C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 3A07 00FD 3BDF 0293 0634 3DE8 0095 057F 3284 12BE 05F3 00BC 00B2 3CA2 0095 3DF8 3DFE 0056 3E08 09C8 3E13 00B2 04C2 32F1 0019 FFFF 3BDF ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Think of Orxx as your representatives . We dialog through them with the aliens . Alien languages are translated by Olgo, the onboard translator ..."
00002CCA: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 006C 3BDF 0056 0A86 00FD 0426 3E19 1D8E 3E1F 0019 FFFF 3BDF ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The Orxx are one of Cap'n Bob's finest creations ..."
00002CEA: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 05E9 0092 1158 0C2D 32F1 0095 031D 3312 0630 00B2 3DFE 02E7 00B2 09D7 0019 FFFF 05E9 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Olga is our cybernetic translator . She knows all the languages in the universe ..."
00002D14: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 05E9 0092 158D 0F77 3318 02E7 3E29 0095 2487 0F1D 0010 00DC 00A3 0019 FFFF 05E9 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Olga is very highly paid in MEGAWATTS . More than me , Commander ..."
00002D3C: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 05E9 3E33 3E3E 0305 036A 0305 0095 031D 3E45 2853 036A 38B5 2D29 0019 FFFF 05E9 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Olga translates almost word for word . She doesn't care for nasty language ..."
00002D64: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 17C0 0274 056C 26DC 0169 05E9 00DC 00A3 0095 02B3 158D 3E4D 0019 FFFF 05E9 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Never say anything bad about Olga , Commander . She's very touchy ..."
00002D8A: TEXT 08BA FF 40 80 - - 0555 055C 25B1 050B 3E54 3E59 3E5D 3E63 2886 3E69 05E9 1043 FFFF 05E9 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x40,0x80 "MISTER HONK CAN JUST SHUT HIS LYING MOUTH ..... SIGNED Olga ...."
00002DAE: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 0B37 03E5 0199 037E 00DC 00A3 0019 0199 0252 0257 0019 FFFF 05E9 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "See what I mean , Commander ... I told you ..."
00002DD0: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 006C 03D1 03F1 0092 0A86 00FD 0426 3E19 3E70 00DC 00A3 0095 2EC1 3E7B 00B2 03D1 03F1 07E3 09EA 0A7C 101B 00B2 09D7 0019 1631 1707 3E45 3E82 0A7C 0019 FFFF 3BE4 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "The BIG BANG is one of Cap'n Bob's inventions , Commander . He thinks the BIG BANG will help him understand the universe ... Old age doesn't suit him ..."
00002E18: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 01AC 3E87 0605 0010 00B2 03D1 03F1 0092 3E94 00DC 00A3 0095 0199 0229 0AD0 00C1 3E99 3EA2 3EA8 012F 3EB1 0326 0019 FFFF 3BE4 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "My calculations tell me the BIG BANG is fake , Commander . I think it's a deformed prism designed to fool us ..."
00002E52: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 07A3 05A2 3B77 0257 0142 0010 00DC 0199 0229 207E 3EB6 3EBE 042C 0A10 12F4 24F3 02E7 1483 0019 FFFF 3BE4 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Commander, just between you and me , I think ol' Buzzard Man Bob has another idea in mind ..."
00002E84: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 1477 147D 0056 36C0 3EC2 22A7 11F9 05BB 089B 0142 3ECA 11F9 0019 FFFF 3BED ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Black holes are amazing devices which space out time and temporise space ..."
00002EAA: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 241F 00E3 14F2 12BE 00C1 3C3D 3ED4 00DC 00E3 0056 1351 012F 3ED9 3EE2 0142 3EE6 3EEC 00DC 00A3 0019 FFFF 3BED ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "If we travel through a black hole , we are sure to discover NEW and WEIRD UNIVERSES , Commander ..."
00002EDE: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 016F 3EF6 3EFB 3C3D 147D 0092 0A14 3F02 3F0D 00DC 00A3 0019 FFFF 3BED ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "What lies beyond black holes is an unfathomed mystery , Commander ..."
00002F02: TEXT 08BA FF 60 80 - - 00A3 00DC 0199 0A21 3B07 0630 00FD 00C1 3F15 0019 FFFF 3BED ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x60,0x80 "Commander , I feel dizzy all of a sudden ..."
00002F22: TEXT 08BA FF 21 80 - - 07D9 024B 00A3 0019 ; TEXT line=0x08BA voice=0xFF flags=0x21,0x80 "Yes ! Commander ..."
